#: smartcard.cpp:381
msgid ""
"<h1>smartcard</h1> This module allows you to configure KDE support for "
"smartcards. These can be used for various tasks such as storing SSL "
"certificates and logging in to the system."
msgstr ""
"<h1>SmartCard</h1> KDE'neñ SmartCard totuın bu modul aşa köyläp bula. Alar "
"törle eşlär öçen qullanıla ala, alar arasında SSL tanıqlıqlar saqlaw öçen da, "
"sistemgä kerü."
